[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NEWTON-MERIT-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Preserve final physical convergence and finite guards
STATEMENT: >>>
Globalization weights shall not replace final dimensional residual or update acceptance, alter default iteration budgets, silently retain Gmin, or bypass provider failure checks. Malformed/nonfinite row references and merit arithmetic shall fail explicitly, while finite oversized trial directions remain eligible for backtracking.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: src/newton.rs convergence checks and finite guards. Verification: continuation_hardening, nonlinear, difficult_continuation, continuation_networks and november3_globalization_contracts tests; pending endurance-seed replay. No claim of universal Newton convergence follows from this finite evidence.
<<<
